{"1568010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crescent Overload", "steam_appid": 1568010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568010/extras/4c98bcdc4e52b5fe606a16e2d56c0b59.avif?t=1779914416\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568010/extras_big/4c98bcdc4e52b5fe606a16e2d56c0b59.avif?t=1779914416 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRESCENT OVERLOAD is an Action 3D platformer with major neo-Y2K inspirations, set inside a virtual cyberscape. You play as AL.exe, the newest programmed proto, as she explores <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">YSB2aXJ0dWFsIChyZWFsPykgd29ybGQ</span></i> with her Gear Scythe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, fluid movement that combines AL.exe's moveset, her Gear Scythe, and the world around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intertwined world with enemies, secrets, and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat which combines movement with bullethell design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story <span class=\"bb_strike\"><i>YWJvdXQgbm9zdGFsZ2lh</i></span> set in a fictional game. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">YSBsb3ZlbGV0dGVyIHRvIG91ciBwYXN0</span></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568010/extras/4c98bcdc4e52b5fe606a16e2d56c0b59.avif?t=1779914416\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568010/extras_big/4c98bcdc4e52b5fe606a16e2d56c0b59.avif?t=1779914416 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRESCENT O